    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="namespacetle92466ed_1_1PERIOD" kindref="compound">PERIOD</ref> register bit definitions and helper functions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>PWM period configuration for ICC mode.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Bit Map:</title><para><verbatim>* Bit 11   : LOW_FREQ - Low frequency range (8x multiplier)
* Bits 10-8: PERIOD_EXP - Period exponent (0-7)
* Bits 7-0 : PERIOD_MANT - Period mantissa (0-255)
* </verbatim></para>
</simplesect>
<bold>Formulas</bold>:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Standard: T_pwm = PERIOD_MANT × 2^PERIOD_EXP × (1/f_sys)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Low Freq: T_pwm = PERIOD_MANT × 8 × 2^PERIOD_EXP × (1/f_sys)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Where f_sys = 28 MHz (PLL-stabilized, see datasheet §4.2.1 Table 10 p.16), so 1/f_sys ≈ 35.714 ns (≈ 1/28 µs). </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
    <location file="inc/tle92466ed_registers.hpp" line="672" column="1"/>
